","quote":"廬陵王子卿字雲長，世祖第三子也。","note":"王號或廟號隨此本紀與王傳識別。","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-040-wangci-ziqing","book_id":"b-nanqishu-040","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-040-wangci-ziqing-ws2272748"},{"start":68,"end":71,"surface":"廬陵王","id":"c-nanshi-022-wangci:p003:r0068","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangci:p003","person_id":"kix_r92_2ed_E","referent_role":"third_person","quote":"慈妻劉彥節女，子觀尚武帝長女吳縣公主，修婦禮，姑未嘗交答。江夏王鋒為南徐州，王妃，慈女也，以慈為東海太守，行南徐州府州事。還為冠軍將軍、廬陵王中軍長史，未拜，永明九年卒。贈太常，諡懿。子泰。","note":"本句按敘述視點回指廬。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangci","book_id":"b-nanshi-022","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-022-wangci-ws1477957"}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-liangshu-021-wangjun-wangcong:p002","text":"峻少美風姿，善舉止。起家著作佐郎，不拜，累遷中軍廬陵王法曹行參軍，太子舍人，邵陵王文學，太傅主簿。府主齊竟陵王子良甚相賞遇。遷司徒主簿，以父憂去職。服闋，除太子洗馬，建安王友。出爲寧遠將軍、桂陽內史。會義師起，上流諸郡多相驚擾，峻閉門靜坐，一郡帖然，百姓賴之。","mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-021-wangjun-wangcong:p002:m0000","surface":"峻","start":0,"end":1,"person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAABAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-021-wangjun-wangcong:p002:m0055","surface":"子良","start":55,"end":57,"person_id":"x3q_cqm_dup","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-021-wangjun-wangcong:p002:m0114","surface":"峻","start":114,"end":115,"person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAABAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-021-wangjun-wangcong:p002:u0125","surface":"百姓","start":125,"end":127,"person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"桂陽民眾合稱。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"revision_id":1544250,"source_layer":"received_biography","first_line":35,"last_line":35,"line_start":2,"line_end":132